cy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-22T20:25:37Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:09:48Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nDetect no params w/ manual version_id counter and set to itself\n\nFixed bug where programmatic version_id counter in conjunction with\njoined table inheritance would fail if the version_id counter\nwere not actually incremented and no other values on the base table\nwere modified, as the UPDATE would have an empty SET clause.  Since\nprogrammatic version_id where version counter is not incremented\nis a documented use case, this specific condition is now detected\nand the UPDATE now sets the version_id value to itself, so that\nconcurrency checks still take place.\n\nChange-Id: I80e385bffeed4851cc20131cbe983c173a46f655\nFixes: #3996\n\n\n→ 0a67c1305266\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441937638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https